From 63246848131382cb525ee846408c0271b01aa448 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 13:29:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper dash: IPv6 internet card + client-list v6, Mode pill
 in topbar, ASCII-safe text

Internet card per approved mock: IPv4/IPv6 header chips, dual-stack v6 line + Gateway(v6)/DNS(v6) meta row, v6-only hero promotion; driven by wan_ipv6_network() hook; connected state counts either stack. Client rows: IPv4 - IPv6 (ip6_prefix||ip6 from networkmap) - MAC. Operation Mode moved to topbar pill between WAN and Uptime. All non-ASCII chars replaced with entities/JS escapes because the www packaging minifier strips non-ASCII bytes (affected every prior build: middots/em-dashes/degree signs silently deleted).
---
 release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp | 183 +++++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 112 insertions(+), 71 deletions(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp b/release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp
